# Groupie Tracker Filters

A web application for browsing and filtering artists and bands using data from the Groupie Trackers API.

## Features

* Display artists and bands
* Search artists by name
* Filter by creation date
* Filter by first album date
* Filter by number of members
* Filter by location
* Filter by number of locations
* Filter by number of concerts
* Combine multiple filters
* Open a separate artist page with detailed information
* Display relations between artists, locations and concerts

## Technologies

* Go
* HTML
* CSS
* Go `html/template`
* REST API
* Git / GitHub

